                                θs ∈
                                  G08BGaussianLaw.confSet Ωd m W F X (G08BGaussianLaw.threshold (n - F.rank) α)
                                    (m θs + WithLp.toLp 2 (F.mulVec β) + ε ω)} =
                            ENNReal.ofReal (1 - α)
